; Ask memory, and keep re-asking a cleaned query until confident.
; Shows discrete control flow (BRC) driven by the continuous confidence register.
; expect: bo sibling
LOAD   r0, #bo
LOAD   r1, #sibling
BIND   r2, r1, r0
again:
RECALL r3, r2, @0
PERM   r3, r3, -1
CLEAN  r4, r3
BRC    0.10, :again    ; with no noise this passes first time
EMIT   r4
HALT
